<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1b3d48cbc969> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The live facial recognition system that the government claims blankets three-quarters of Buenos Aires was launched in 2019, and had accumulated 140 police checks or arrests based on database errors when it was discontinued in March of 2020 due to the Covid pandemic." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1c20853e92bc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Los dispositivos permiten identificar los rostros de las personas prófugas en menos de medio segundo, vinculándolos con la base de datos de la Consulta Nacional de Rebeldías y Capturas (Conarc)." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/245d93a62595> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "the facial recognition system...went live in 2019" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/274ffc0ff546> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "El Sistema de Reconocimiento Facial entró en vigencia hace 60 días en la ciudad de Buenos Aires." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2b3df9b9f4ab> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Según las fuentes de la Policía de la Ciudad, en muchos de estos casos los jueces desistieron de los arrestos porque se trataba de causas viejas o liberaron a los imputados luego de ser notificados." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ef5ad6fc01f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "How We Investigated Mass Surveillance in Argentina" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/45531582dd1b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "debido a alguna deficiencia en la carga de datos en el Registro Nacional de Reincidencia" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/693befd8fcc1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"Hay asesinos, violadores, ladrones, que estaban caminando por las calles de la ciudad al lado de nuestro y de nuestras familias. Son exactamente 1.043 delincuentes que fueron puestos a disposición de la Justicia\", sostuvo el jefe de Gobierno, Horacio Rodríguez Larreta." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7935d1e45cbf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Problems in Argentina’s justice system exacerbated by public facial recognition: report" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7b3f47a530f3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "el software detecta el género de la persona con una precisión del 99 por ciento y la edad en un 95 por ciento." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/86d83965caa8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "facial recognition system in Buenos Aires had identified him as a criminal" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/90805c4abaa4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Patricia Bullrich, la ex ministra de seguridad argentina que dejó el cargo en diciembre de 2019, tuiteó regularmente elogios ." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/90c49dcc6cce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A data entry error in a database used for facial recognition in Argentina has highlighted problems with the country’s justice system" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/95e9dc2e8a42> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A data entry error in a database used for facial recognition in Argentina has highlighted problems with the country’s justice system; problems that are made worse by the use of the real-time biometric technology in public, according to Wired." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9eb892da06c5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Eso incluye un video publicado el 4 de febrero que afirma que el sistema de reconocimiento facial había atrapado a un sospechoso buscado por Interpol por robo con agravantes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a00169a22dd1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "La policía argentina arresta a personas inocentes basándose en el reconocimiento facial" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a6e71b880f75> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "We searched and found not only Guillermo Ibarrola, but also other victims by looking at media reports and tweets about false positives, and by contacting lawyers and the Ombudsman's Office of the City of Buenos Aires." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ab79afce1f0b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The city of Buenos Aires is now in a legal battle for it to be switched back on." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/af99d939e8a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The use of AI in public spaces, such as facial recognition technology, receives relatively little media coverage." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b1825dd9e280> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "We searched and found not only Guillermo Ibarrola, but also other victims" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bc0b88b70c5f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But the facial recognition system, part of the city's sprawling surveillance infrastructure, is being criticized after at least 140 other database errors led to police checks or arrests after the system went live in 2019." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c73871425981> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "En julio de 2019, Guillermo Federico Ibarrola se dirigía a su casa en el metro cuando fue detenido por la policía de Buenos Aires." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/dd67cf20fe5b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tigre, una ciudad a unas 20 millas al norte de Buenos Aires, tiene 2.000 cámaras que transmiten imágenes a un centro de comando central que opera el software NEC." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e6ff04cfbcb5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The personal data of prominent politicians from different parties, as well as human rights activists and journalists were searched, according to Judge Andrés Gallardo, who investigated it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e98919e99077> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "En mayo de 2019, un informe de las Naciones Unidas cuestionó la legitimidad de la base de datos de CONARC, diciendo que la base de datos contiene delitos de tan bajo nivel como un simple robo." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ef9a92b6e342> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "El sistema de reconocimiento facial en vivo de Buenos Aires puede funcionar con 300 imágenes de cámara a la vez y envía automáticamente una notificación a la policía a través de la aplicación de mensajería Telegram cuando encuentra una coincidencia potencial." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f432a29cb742> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Coincidió con el rostro de una persona incluida en una lista de observación con un flujo de video que recibió." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fe110dc0b3a5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "dijo Rodríguez Larreta, acompañado por su vicejefe y ministro de Seguridad, Diego Santilli." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/Stakeholder/442233171c6b> a airo:Stakeholder ;
    rdfs:label "NtechLab" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "1.0"^^xsd:float ;
    airo:develops <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/7bba0f4e0bee>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/7c5c06a2bc5b>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/aed0b4728819>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/b3b086236334> ;
    airo:extractionMode "explicit" ;
    airo:hasDescription "NtechLab" ;
    airo:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/91616410095e>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ef23d3c5fe5d> ;
    airo:hasSourceDocument <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/document/6372>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/document/6374> ;
    airo:hasSupportCount 2 ;
    airo:provides <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/7bba0f4e0bee>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/7c5c06a2bc5b>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/aed0b4728819>,
        <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/b3b086236334> .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ebd2f6f6221> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The cameras of the facial recognition system in Buenos Aires had identified him as a criminal" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/403f0422cb4a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "El sistema de reconocimiento facial de Buenos Aires se propuso como una forma de capturar a las personas buscadas de la base de datos nacional de fugitivos del país, llamada Consulta Nacional de Rebeldías y Capturas (CONARC)." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/57a12c3b05b2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "En abril pasado, el gobierno de Buenos Aires anunció que las cámaras del metro de la ciudad estarían conectadas a un sistema llamado Sistema de Reconocimiento Facial de Fugitivos." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8060897012a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"A nightmare\" is how Guillermo Federico Ibarrola describes his arrest" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8bc7449ec929> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "vinculándolos con la base de datos de la Consulta Nacional de Rebeldías y Capturas (Conarc), perteneciente al Registro Nacional de Reincidencias, que cuenta con más de 46.000 imágenes de delincuentes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e8ff32d9439e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "debido a alguna deficiencia en la carga de datos en el Registro Nacional de Reincidencia." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8538" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f869d33f94ae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "at least 140 other database errors led to police checks or arrests after the system went live in 2019" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/beb2c0cd3880> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The City of Buenos Aires successfully sought Gallardo’s removal from the investigation, and he and former city security minister Marcelo D’Alessandro have filed lawsuits against each other." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2746d2477313> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In July, coastal resort city Mar del Plata announced plans to deploy live facial recognition in public, and a desire to use the fugitive database." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4293e9162c23> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The IT specialists who searched the servers of the Ministry of Security on a court order came to an outrageous suspicion: Was facial recognition used to create a Big Data database or even to monitor individuals?" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5f93dae71da5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "So we made a second inquiry, this time to a public prosecutor's office specializing in corruption cases, which is now also dealing with this issue." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9f097524af1a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This very idea was reinforced when we learned about Judge Gallardo's judicial research: Suddenly, the question arose whether the facial recognition system might have been used for surveillance or Big Data." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bbb90a28a3d0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"A nightmare\" is how Guillermo Federico Ibarrola describes his arrest. The cameras of the facial recognition system in Buenos Aires had identified him as a criminal." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4028" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fff462fcefad> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Local company Danaide installed the cameras for the system, winning the contract six minutes after it was tendered." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6372" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/7bba0f4e0bee> a airo:AISystem ;
    rdfs:label "Fugitive Facial Recognition System" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "1.0"^^xsd:float ;
    airo:extractionMode "explicit" ;
